          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">Curated for modern living</span>
            <h1>Dark mode for your next obsession.</h1>
            <p class="hero-copy">
              Discover elevated essentials across fashion, home, tech, and beauty with limited drops,
              expressive design, and fast-moving seasonal edits.
            </p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a class="button-primary" href="#featured">Browse featured products</a>
              <a class="button-secondary" href="#journal">Read the journal</a>
            </div>
